note Exercism-style exercise "scrabble-score": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/scrabble-score
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note score is the Scrabble score of word, ignoring case: AEIOULNRST 1, DG 2, BCMP 3, FHVWY 4, K 5,
note JX 8, QZ 10.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/scrabble-score
om2
note letter values A .. Z, each stored as 48 + value (":" is 10)
text sv "1332142418513113:11114484:"
fn score word view uchar * to ulong
t = ulong 0
for i ulong len word
c = get word i
if and ge c 97 le c 122
c = sub c 32
end
if and ge c 65 le c 90
t = add t ulong sub get sv ulong sub c 65 48
end
end
ret t
end
